# Filter rules for this repo:
#   - Any file sitting DIRECTLY in a Day folder (labs, slides, pdfs, anything)
#     is kept as-is.
#   - Inside competition subfolders (and extracted from zips), only notebooks,
#     scripts and READMEs are kept — data files are never committed.
#   - Dataset zips themselves are never committed (data lives on Drive/Kaggle);
#     run scripts/extract_notebooks_from_zips.py to surface their notebooks.

# 1) ignore everything by default...
*

# 2) ...but keep descending into folders
!*/

# 3) keep EVERY direct file inside a day folder (labs, slides, ...)
!days/*/*

# 4) ...except data archives and datasets at that level
days/*/*.zip
days/*/*.csv
days/*/*.tsv
days/*/*.parquet
days/*/*.json
days/*/*.jsonl
days/*/*.npy
days/*/*.npz
days/*/*.pkl
days/*/*.pt
days/*/*.pth
days/*/*.h5
days/*/desktop.ini

# 5) deeper levels (comp folders): keep only these
!*.ipynb
!*.py
!README.md

# 6) repo files at the root
!*.md
!*.sh
!.gitignore

# never these, anywhere
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
desktop.ini
kaggle.json
